{"id":"n26824-2-3","stage":1,"title":"다르다 · 与众不同","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26824-2-3-1","ko":"봐, 이 문제는 이렇게 풀면 쉽게 풀리는 문제야.","zh":"看，这道题只要用这种方法解，就很容易解决了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"봐,","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문제는","meaning":"题，问题","explanation":"문제：题，问题；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"1","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"풀면","meaning":"解开，解答","explanation":"풀다：解开，解答；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"풀다","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29761","senseId":"5","lemma":"풀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉽게","meaning":"容易，简单","explanation":"쉽다：容易，简单；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쉽다","audio":"/audio/a39c0e9196a70295a55f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66314","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"풀리는","meaning":"解开，解答","explanation":"풀리다：解开，解答；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"풀리다","audio":"/audio/aba31e511b1563e0e599.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62314","senseId":"4","lemma":"풀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문제야.","meaning":"题，问题","explanation":"문제：题，问题；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"1","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"题，问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"要求解答的题目。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"cada9014a11f228c","term":"풀다","zh":"解开，解答","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3","entryId":"29761","definition":"解决不懂、复杂的问题或找到其答案。","pronunciation":["풀다"]},{"id":"a39c0e9196a70295","term":"쉽다","zh":"容易，简单","audio":"/audio/a39c0e9196a70295a55f.mp3","entryId":"66314","definition":"做起来不累或不难。","pronunciation":["쉽ː따"]},{"id":"aba31e511b1563e0","term":"풀리다","zh":"解开，解答","audio":"/audio/aba31e511b1563e0e599.mp3","entryId":"62314","definition":"不知道或复杂的问题被解决或找到答案。","pronunciation":["풀리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/25b42c1dfc5470d31d13.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26824-2-3-2","ko":"역시 대학생이 다르기는 다르군요.","zh":"果然大学生就是不一样啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"역시","meaning":"果然","explanation":"역시：果然","readings":[{"term":"역시","audio":"/audio/112d19723c425ab6813b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67372","senseId":"2","lemma":"역시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대학생이","meaning":"大学生","explanation":"대학생：大学生；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"대학생","audio":"/audio/12ac14be4eec99bb2fe1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66320","senseId":"1","lemma":"대학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다르기는","meaning":"与众不同，非同一般","explanation":"다르다：与众不同，非同一般；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"2","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다르군요.","meaning":"与众不同，非同一般","explanation":"다르다：与众不同，非同一般；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"2","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"112d19723c425ab6","term":"역시","zh":"果然","audio":"/audio/112d19723c425ab6813b.mp3","entryId":"67372","definition":"和所想的一样。","pronunciation":["역씨"]},{"id":"12ac14be4eec99bb","term":"대학생","zh":"大学生","audio":"/audio/12ac14be4eec99bb2fe1.mp3","entryId":"66320","definition":"读大学的学生。","pronunciation":["대ː학쌩"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"与众不同，非同一般","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"与普通的事物或人不一样，有特别的一面。","pronunciation":["다르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4de54c4e8cf970aaf62c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26824","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":51,"sequenceScore":2.2261,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["果然大学生就是不一样啊。","老师，这些书要全部放在哪里呢？","看，这道题只要用这种方法解，就很容易解决了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["果然大学生就是不一样啊。","看，这道题只要用这种方法解，就很容易解决了。","老师，这些书要全部放在哪里呢？"],"answer":0}]}
